[00:23.339]That snowflake once fell on my nose (那片雪花曾落在我的鼻尖)
[00:28.385]now flying backwards to last winter (现在正倒飞回往年冬天)
[00:34.597]I realize that hellos are goodbyes (我意识到，问候即告别)
[00:39.707]The moment I softly let go of your hand (当我轻轻松开你的手)
[00:46.145]Winds hum through the trembling branches (风在颤抖的枝桠间呼啸而过)
[00:51.118]A song for a soul bound to soar to (唱着一首歌)
[00:54.672]The very edge of the starry ocean (献给注定飞往星海尽头的灵魂)
[00:57.623]Even if we're meant to fall apart (即便我们注定分道扬镳)
[01:02.467]I will gaze at where you are for all time (在所有的时间里，我都会朝着你的方向凝望)
[01:07.614]Bon voyage (旅途愉快)
[01:10.441]May your path be clear (愿你的道路清晰无阻)
[01:13.280]May you get to where dreams are all crystalline and sweet (愿你抵达之处，美梦都晶莹甜美)
[01:20.412]Please crack a little smile (笑一笑吧)
[01:24.730]You won't be alone (你不会孤单)
[01:27.337]In this world you've chosen as your own (在你选择的世界里)
[01:31.921]Don't worry (别担心)
[01:33.886]I'm well aware that all snowflakes melt in the end (我深知所有雪花最终都会融化)
[01:43.271]Which is sign of warmth and hope of spring (这也是开春温暖与希望的信号)
[01:47.958]So I'll dance flamboyantly into that good night (所以我将明艳地舞进那良夜)
[02:04.741]Bon voyage (旅途愉快)
[02:07.595]May your path be clear (愿你的道路清晰无阻)
[02:10.385]May you get to where dreams are all crystalline and sweet (愿你抵达之处，美梦都晶莹甜美)
[02:17.597]Please crack a little smile (笑一笑吧)
[02:21.888]You won't be alone (你不会孤单)
[02:24.501]In this world you've chosen as your own (在你选择的世界里)
[02:29.120]Timing is such a dazzling riddle (时间是个如此令人眼花缭乱的谜题)
[02:34.699]Guess I'll spend my whole life unraveling it (看来我得用一生来解开它了)
[02:40.469]Though it might cost me everything I have (尽管这可能会让我付出拥有的一切)
[02:46.114]I never regret it, wouldn't have it any other way cuz (我心已决，这就是我想要的注定)
[02:51.922]Those who trace starlight on their lonely roads (因为那些在孤独道路上追寻星光的人)
[02:57.507]Will find their destinations in the cosmos (终将在宇宙中寻找到他们的归处)
[03:03.284]Meeting you in that swirling snowfall's (那天在漫天纷扬的雪花中与你相遇)
[03:08.841]the most beautiful thing ever happened to me (是在我身上发生过的最美好的事情)
